{
  "_comment": "SYNTHETIC example. POST to https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/schemas once (needs crm.schemas.custom.write). HubSpot will assign the fully qualified name p<portalId>_competitor_pricing (placeholder portal 99000001 → p99000001_competitor_pricing). Remove this _comment key before sending.",
